{"steam_appid":3521660,"steam_name":"Blind Touch","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3521660/1132082171/7d9a063b8a34a081f965a72bf6d38f8676931b58/1768214947/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768215519","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257263461/03f39a5bc00126b6d481ee7884b9e861d1ee288f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768215519","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/c9059352b08e57b9b5fb017cc0f4ec98f7d94ba4/ss_c9059352b08e57b9b5fb017cc0f4ec98f7d94ba4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782265478","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/4090c846e08f6dc2965bbcdcdcdaed90a4d9f22e/ss_4090c846e08f6dc2965bbcdcdcdaed90a4d9f22e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782265478","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/94f53be352a9a2c5a9afad6389eb06637f8de40d/ss_94f53be352a9a2c5a9afad6389eb06637f8de40d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782265478","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/db8c6d7927235b6e3559b0be5515ba87c9dc9bdf/ss_db8c6d7927235b6e3559b0be5515ba87c9dc9bdf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782265478","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/43738bbb29e0a35571e6a99b43fff2b580d48bc8/ss_43738bbb29e0a35571e6a99b43fff2b580d48bc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782265478"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Can't See!</strong> <strong>but your senses draws the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your vision and memory due to an accident. Your guide cane became your new &quot;eye&quot;! You navigate environments that are familiar or distant— home, subway, a bustling street—illuminating objects through touch and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/21cd0566f6304f0ee161f7c610594149.poster.avif?t=1782265478\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/21cd0566f6304f0ee161f7c610594149.webm?t=1782265478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/21cd0566f6304f0ee161f7c610594149.mp4?t=1782265478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Your Cane</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each touch, your cane brings the world to life. Uncover objects that hold meaning, from a humming boombox to the scent of a flowering plant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/e7fe9880f499256b7755c44b4f618bda.poster.avif?t=1782265478\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/e7fe9880f499256b7755c44b4f618bda.webm?t=1782265478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/e7fe9880f499256b7755c44b4f618bda.mp4?t=1782265478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this unique experience immersive, whether you’re a casual player seeking a heartfelt narrative journey, or someone who wants the tension of a true-to-life simulation. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/68a44199c54082918a85da32b35d3957.poster.avif?t=1782265478\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/68a44199c54082918a85da32b35d3957.webm?t=1782265478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/68a44199c54082918a85da32b35d3957.mp4?t=1782265478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Discover, and Interact</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your surroundings not just by cane, but through hearing, memory, and imagination. Listen for distant footsteps, the rush of a subway train, or the breeze through trees as you piece together your world. </p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Flygogo Games"],"publishers":["Flygogo Games"],"release_date":"4 Feb, 2026"}